Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Philosopher's Stone\Nwould be in a desolate town like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:12.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It almost seems like a lie that up until just recently,\Nthis town was prosperous from gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:16.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why they would be that much more likely to research the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since they stopped being able to get gold out of the mines,\Nthey'd want to transmute it with the Philosopher's Stone that much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This used to be a gold\Nproducing area, and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so if they created just a little,\Nno one would find them out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's terrible the way grown-ups think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, give me a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use! It won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.\NWe're going to help you\Nout of there, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:00:58.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My daughter is pinned!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:08.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be patient for a bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:33.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:42.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, to think that an alchemist would come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really came through for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his armored father too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, we're brothers, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Younger brother? Even though\Nhe's bigger than you, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we're glad that you weren't hurt, Elisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.59,0:04:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:10.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Elisa all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle Belsio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.27,0:04:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How dare you\Ncome into my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After making Elisa\Nhelp you out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Elisa.\NNo matter what anyone tells you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can't help Belsio out in his work anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Uncle Belsio's fault! \NI asked him to let me help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Elisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:53.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uncle Belsio told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that your lemon pies\Nwere the best, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that it was a shame that there were so few farms left in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.49,0:05:16.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey now, once the Philosopher's Stone is finished,\Nthe town will become prosperous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:18.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be able to buy our fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two came to assist\NMugear-sama in his research, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To create a Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Alchemist, please create the Philosopher's Stone as soon as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to get back our town of gold—\NXenotime—no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're depending on you, Master Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's a lot to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in any case, I guess we'll go see this Mugear person.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you would please\Ntell us your names?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Edward. Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:06:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-His brother, Alphonse.\NAlphonse Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The State Alchemist ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:18.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The real Elric brothers are already up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back when you've decided to be honest about your real names!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is it that's been\Nusing my name here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you really planning to sneak in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to catch that impostor
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and have him tell me about the Philosopher's Stone while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother? Was that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A transmutative reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this. This is all material on the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, this is where they're making\Nthe Philosopher's Stone, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place is off-limits to unauthorized persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance, are you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are, you impostors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which would mean that\Nyou're the real Edward, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! No! I'm Edward! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the older brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The security guys will\Nrealize you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:08:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know, the real \Nyounger brother wears armor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look like you're fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you want to go at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you guys will go home quietly, I don't plan on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just let us stay here\Nfor a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that any attitude to be asking somebody for something with?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:20.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop looking down on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That would bother you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being only that tall,\Nwhen you're fifteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Automail, huh? The real one\Nhas his troubles too, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:41.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By saying that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you sound as if you haven't just been living in idleness yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have a look at the skill of a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be sorry you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad. No transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The impostor doesn't use\Na transmutation circle either?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!\NHave you got a Philosopher's Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:28.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that noise just now?!\NThis way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! I ache all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That impostor sure was strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just the Stone's power, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:45.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, I wonder if they've completed a Philosopher's Stone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to\Nmake sure we find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what those\Nbrothers' names are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:59.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of them must\Nhave real names, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the older brother is older than you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:08.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go judging us\Njust on our size!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:13.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, let's give this up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:17.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If those two report what's really going on, what will we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody is going to believe what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and complete the\NPhilosopher's Stone and leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it goes that smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to let Mugear get the credit for the research Dad spent his whole life on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it comes to that, I'll make sure that\Nno matter what, at least you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,make me happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you should just be standing there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.81,0:11:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems some outsiders have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:17.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, but not to worry. \NThe Elric brothers have been chased away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys could prove to be extraordinarily crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, having come to this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's only a matter of time before the military comes to learn of the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that maybe it's about time you pulled out, Mugear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a little more time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I will complete the Philosopher's Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:45.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use any means that you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's starting to swell up pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your coldness feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to be of use to you, Brother, even in this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were at the store this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you have no place to stay, come to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:25.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.55,0:12:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't let you children\Nsleep outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:32.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not going to\Nask us our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the Elric brothers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:38.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, you believe us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:39.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just think that everyone has their own reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who bears responsibility for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't appear to have any interest in the Philosopher's Stone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:58.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks in this town\Nare still unable to forget the wealth that gold has brought them,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Mugear has them\Nwrapped around his finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Uncle Belsio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you keep coming to my place,\Nyou're going to get yelled at again by your pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Papa is all wrapped up in talk about the gold mine. He won't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, that looks like it hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you get\Nfor telling lies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we're not the ones who are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet {\i1}I'm{\i0} the one\Nwho gets clocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't mean, you're the ones who snuck into Mugear-sama's mansion yesterday, Big Brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course it was us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't let those impostors get away with this, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, using a Philosopher's Stone to make gold is no small matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:48.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go see\Nwhat's happening in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you go to\Nthe drugstore for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:10.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to get\NElisa's medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and your brother needs a compress too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, it's that armor.\NHe's that impostor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear! I wish he would hurry up and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll bet it was those boys who broke in \Nto rob Mugear-sama's mansion last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What have you come here for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I need to get some medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any medicine\Nthat treats liars!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I give up. I can't buy\Nany medicine like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:52.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go buy your medicine for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An equivalent exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to apologize for us lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both of us have it hard when our older brothers act rash, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have your reasons, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For us to participate in Mugear-san's research,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:22.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we needed to use\Nnames such as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:25.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be a child {\i1}and{\i0}\Na State Alchemist—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the Elric brothers are\Nthe only ones around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:31.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need the Philosopher's Stone that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something my dad spent his whole life researching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, your father was an alchemist as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, one day,\Nhe was suddenly gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:50.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why my brother is forcing himself to carry on after our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the complete \Nopposite of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother hates our dad,\Nwho was also an alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our dad was completely absorbed in alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.73,0:16:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and our mom suffered because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:11.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've also seen a bunch of other people who have met with sadness because of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, if your brother is doing something wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're the only one\Nwho can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't make others do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do, I think your brother will be deeply hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been a little concerned about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but aren't there a lot of people coughing around town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:43.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this cough medicine, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:56.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:08.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The impostor is here! The older one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:14.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That bastard! What a hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's been fixing the townspeople's hoes and transmuting wheels for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's better than having him do bad things, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't like the way he operates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's ignoring the Law of Equivalent Exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, we're going to\Nsneak in there again tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though it's the very next day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:37.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Because{\i0} it's the very next day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something\NI want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going with\Nthe mole-man strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:11.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mole-man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, we should be just about under the building now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.50,0:18:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we're going to\Ncome out somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.22,0:18:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be the water that forms the base of the red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The red stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I read some documents about it\Nat the library in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a stone, made of a compound of roughly the same material
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as the Philosopher's Stone,\Nwhich you get by refining red water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, you can make a Philosopher's Stone from this water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:59.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, it won't be the\Nexact same thing, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I remember, some alchemist named Nash-something-or-other was researching it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.37,0:19:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but in the end, it didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.66,0:19:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.71,0:19:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I suddenly feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? What are you crying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you know something, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really don't like\Nwhat's going on here, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That red water...\NIt's water that's very\Ndangerous to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's vital for creating a red stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, the people in town are also coughing because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:14.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll just smash all of this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:19.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've finally raised up\Na red stone this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:27.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My dad sacrificed himself for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If his experiments go unfulfilled, he'll never be redeemed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.58,0:20:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so great about that half-baked rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sword is just a fake too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to mess you up, together with your rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:53.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine is the genuine article!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:03.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the red water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.07,0:21:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're showered with it,\Nyou're done for.\NYou won't just lose consciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your brother is right!\NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:28.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose to someone who's chasing after his own pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:48.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fletcher, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:22:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, Dad was \Nresearching the red water
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:22:00.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to bring happiness to people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet what we're doing is making\Nthe people in town suffer, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you should've known this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who\Ngets credit, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:17.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad would not be happy about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 12: "Land of Stones, Part 2"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.56,0:23:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you've taken on the name of Edward Elric,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.82,0:23:48.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are you prepared for\Nthe consequences?!
